{"c":[{"id":"c4a7002f70622f4c","sum":"First npm publish can't use OIDC until the package exists; operator bootstraps then attaches the trusted publisher to release-please.yaml. Test what ships to consumers; don't TDD our own CI unless brittle or critical","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T164639Z-24f339bd495bf5e0","text":"First npm publish cannot use OIDC until the package exists on the registry; operator bootstraps then attaches trusted publisher to release-please.yaml","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T165326Z-f2c174bab504f61d","text":"Test what we ship to consumers; do not TDD our own CI unless it is brittle or critical","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"03ee6ed36f7296a2","sum":"With dist gitignored, skip release-please RP-branch amend jobs (node strategy already patches package-lock versions). main (LICENSE-only) and initialdev were unrelated roots, joined by merging main into initialdev so GitHub could open a PR.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T173113Z-f2b15dcfcd598916","text":"When dist is gitignored, skip release-please RP-branch amend jobs; node strategy already patches package-lock.json version fields","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T173942Z-21c19cef888ffc06","text":"main and initialdev were unrelated Initial commits; main was LICENSE-only. Ancestry joined by merging main into initialdev so GitHub can open a PR.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
